WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.520 --> 00:00:07.112
Scry Sync cannot read InDesign files, so
the row says Needs a PDF.

2
00:00:07.682 --> 00:00:12.496
In InDesign, export a PDF into the synced
folder.

3
00:00:13.066 --> 00:00:17.859
Scry Sync waits until the folder has been
quiet for about a minute,

4
00:00:17.859 --> 00:00:20.291
then converts and sends each page.

5
00:00:20.861 --> 00:00:25.701
The InDesign row keeps saying Needs a PDF,
and that is expected.
